Arduino IDE or PlatformIO libraries:

- Arduino core for ESP32
- Wire
- Notecard
- Ezo_i2c
- Ezo_i2c_util
- ModbusMaster, required for biofloc turbidity versions only

Board used during development:

- Adafruit Feather ESP32-S3

Notes:

- Select the correct ESP32-S3 board in the Arduino IDE.
- Put generated model header files in the same sketch folder as the .ino file.
- Replace YOUR_NOTEHUB_PRODUCT_UID with your own Blues Notehub ProductUID.
